#!args --verify-dirty --rtl
# scroll copies (lib/ui/scrollcopy.rs) in a mirrored window: the recorded commands are mirrored
# before they are hashed, so vertical moves copy as in a left-to-right window (a sideways move
# is drawn again).  The page by the wheel, the virtualized list by Down at its lower edge, at
# 100 % and 150 %; every frame is compared with a full redraw (--verify-dirty)
size 1000 800
theme light
wheel 100,300 -120
wait 300
wheel 100,300 -120
wait 300
wheel 100,300 -120
wait 300
move 100,310
expect #7000 value 144
expect scrollcopy 1
focus #7100
key down down down down down down down down
expect #7100 value 10
expect scrollcopy 2
scale 150
wait 50
key esc
wheel 100,300 120
wait 300
wheel 100,300 120
wait 300
wheel 100,300 120
wait 300
move 100,310
expect scrollcopy 1
expect_nowarn
